oPTJ("[{\"name\":\"Inclinación1\",\"type\":\"SmartphoneOrientation\"},{\"name\":\"TecladoMusical\",\"type\":\"PlayKeyboard\"}]\n{\"bpm\":{\"it\":\"bpm\",\"en\":\"bpm\",\"es\":\"bpm\"},\"intervaloPulso\":{\"it\":\"intervalloBattito\",\"en\":\"beatInterval\",\"es\":\"intervaloPulso\"},\"tiempoTranscurrido\":{\"it\":\"tempoTrascorso\",\"en\":\"elapsedTime\",\"es\":\"tiempoTranscurrido\"},\"ultimoPulso\":{\"it\":\"ultimoBattito\",\"en\":\"lastBeat\",\"es\":\"ultimoPulso\"}}\n<xml xmlns=\"https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml\"><variables><variable id=\"lp22OvmAk}A#z-c`xed0\">ultimoPulso</variable><variable id=\"8xy5:F-Xb],PlBYs`xR8\">bpm</variable><variable id=\"6xsD1(C^EmXH$#~A;uYZ\">intervaloPulso</variable><variable id=\"pq*]}{CbAl6UUX7Dz2_!\">tiempoTranscurrido</variable></variables><block type=\"on_start\" id=\"VO~rhltWb-8AEVTh-VY9\" x=\"13\" y=\"163\"><statement name=\"DO\"><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"hS:Jo4UmC]+~}$d0}^nK\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"lp22OvmAk}A#z-c`xed0\">ultimoPulso</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_number\" id=\"_MpUmN@p03bOz|,1J`KH\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></block></value></block></statement></block><block type=\"main_loop\" id=\"yOO0[YA]%RN);.o_ku:^\" x=\"338\" y=\"163\"><statement name=\"allCode\"><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"y^}$Fe;attIiH1E4wiN!\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"8xy5:F-Xb],PlBYs`xR8\">bpm</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"92\" w=\"360\">[it]Trasforma l'inclinazione in bpm (battiti al minuto): con il telefono orizzontale fa 60, e inclinandolo sale o scende al massimo di circa 50.[it][en]Turns the tilt into bpm (beats per minute): with the phone flat it is 60, and tilting it goes up or down by about 50 at most.[en][es]Convierte la inclinación en bpm (pulsos por minuto): con el celular horizontal da 60, y al inclinarlo sube o baja como mucho unos 50.[es]</comment><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"8OVm.9B-:@Tx2%?~}=t|\"><field name=\"OP\">ADD</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"P0]13cc@jghofY#I!K7|\" disabled=\"true\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"metro-divide\"><field name=\"OP\">DIVIDE</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"metro-divide-a\" disabled=\"true\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"protobject_Inclinación1_get\" id=\":)~zqI)m|O8Dg|vepc+y\"><field name=\"property\">oriX</field></block></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"metro-divide-b\"><field name=\"NUM\">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"G,TGrCna9X,myJi(zX(z\"><field name=\"NUM\">60</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"pjC}QmP^jiA78`cI#M;E\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"6xsD1(C^EmXH$#~A;uYZ\">intervaloPulso</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"92\" w=\"360\">[it]Calcola quanti millisecondi passano tra un battito e il successivo: 60000 (i millisecondi di un minuto) diviso i bpm.[it][en]Works out how many milliseconds go between one beat and the next: 60000 (the milliseconds in a minute) divided by the bpm.[en][es]Calcula cuántos milisegundos hay entre un pulso y el siguiente: 60000 (los milisegundos de un minuto) dividido por los bpm.[es]</comment><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"{$-8HNqiZ=Lx-Phth7Yj\"><field name=\"OP\">DIVIDE</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"?_A~HccP]AE%Yu@]+[E|\"><field name=\"NUM\">60000</field></shadow></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"aQWhw!(8{avx$2d$3v2s\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\" id=\"v/AFoi2EWr%JGYw+O[B9\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"8xy5:F-Xb],PlBYs`xR8\">bpm</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\".4s#|-m:3gnZEA8`@8!A\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"pq*]}{CbAl6UUX7Dz2_!\">tiempoTranscurrido</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"|_lD+Sa6`Ee]RNT@|9!D\"><field name=\"OP\">MINUS</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"6O[2jb3e8Mp?[nY}]SdY\" disabled=\"true\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"protobject_milliseconds\" id=\"r*t|RYcInNMLa!PSS{_-\"></block></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"[fFweER]PyMY60)rx0V(\" disabled=\"true\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\" id=\"^^.-[vO+5XT#~W2?yaQ+\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"lp22OvmAk}A#z-c`xed0\">ultimoPulso</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type=\"controls_if\" id=\"=Q,!lWqAu_DxvU]Oj9m-\"><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"92\" w=\"360\">[it]Se il tempo passato dall'ultimo battito supera già l'intervallo, è ora di un battito nuovo.[it][en]If the time since the last beat is already longer than the interval, it is time for a new beat.[en][es]Si el tiempo que pasó desde el último pulso ya supera el intervalo, es hora de un pulso nuevo.[es]</comment><value name=\"IF0\"><block type=\"logic_compare\" id=\"6ig6d~OsLgyxh#j1Lf:_\"><field name=\"OP\">GT</field><value name=\"A\"><block type=\"variables_get\" id=\"(Zy@a2(;Y9UkqlB-25w`\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"pq*]}{CbAl6UUX7Dz2_!\">tiempoTranscurrido</field></block></value><value name=\"B\"><block type=\"variables_get\" id=\"kuE@9PsAc[AV(}dR%Dn3\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"6xsD1(C^EmXH$#~A;uYZ\">intervaloPulso</field></block></value></block></value><statement name=\"DO0\"><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"F7y0/|x.Lz1s`xVPg+_r\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"lp22OvmAk}A#z-c`xed0\">ultimoPulso</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"92\" w=\"360\">[it]Per prima cosa salva il momento di questo battito: così il cronometro riparte proprio da qui.[it][en]First it saves the moment of this beat: that way the stopwatch starts again from right here.[en][es]Lo primero es guardar el momento de este pulso: así el cronómetro vuelve a empezar justo desde aquí.[es]</comment><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"protobject_milliseconds\" id=\"7A7OnkP)A9k%[X8rK#/,\"></block></value><next><block type=\"protobject_TecladoMusical_play_set_1\" id=\"metro-tic\"><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"68\" w=\"360\">[it]Suona un tic corto, di 100 millisecondi: è il battito del metronomo.[it][en]A short tick plays, 100 milliseconds long: it is the metronome's beat.[en][es]Suena un tic corto, de 100 milisegundos: es el pulso del metrónomo.[es]</comment><value name=\"VAR\"><shadow type=\"control_note\" id=\"metro-tic-n\"><field name=\"VAR\">60</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"protobject_sleep\" id=\"metro-espera\"><field name=\"timingType\">ms</field><value name=\"VAR\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"metro-espera-n\"><field name=\"NUM\">100</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"protobject_TecladoMusical_stop_set_3\" id=\"metro-detener\"></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></xml>")